Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 08:39:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 25/30] [SECURITY-3911] Use Remoting 3352.k2541.1 (3352 line +
 upstream fix 931d3c99)

Adaptation, not an upstream commit. Upstream fixed SECURITY-3911 in a newer
Remoting line. 2.541.3 ships Remoting 3352.v17a_fb_4b_2773f, so the upstream
fix 931d3c99 is applied to that line (patches/remoting) and released here as
3352.k2541.1. This patch points core at that version.

---
 pom.xml | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/pom.xml b/pom.xml
index f76fc2ed34..db1db4fc7a 100644
--- a/pom.xml
+++ b/pom.xml
@@ -87,7 +87,7 @@ THE SOFTWARE.
     <changelog.url>https://www.jenkins.io/changelog</changelog.url>
 
     <!-- Bundled Remoting version -->
-    <remoting.version>3352.v17a_fb_4b_2773f</remoting.version>
+    <remoting.version>3352.k2541.1</remoting.version>
 
     <spotbugs.effort>Max</spotbugs.effort>
     <spotbugs.threshold>Medium</spotbugs.threshold>
